# Copy to .env.local only if you need to override a default.
#
# Every VITE_ variable is embedded in the JavaScript bundle and is readable
# by anyone who loads the app. Only non-secret configuration belongs here:
# never API keys, tokens, or passwords.

# Base URL for API requests. Leave unset to use "/api", which the Vite dev
# server proxies to http://localhost:4000. In production, serve the API
# behind the same origin at /api, or set a full URL here and add that origin
# to the Content Security Policy's connect-src.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
